<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">27082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Two people are dead and hundreds infected in a measles outbreak in Lancaster County, Pennsylvania — and the state's governor is publicly blaming the federal health secretary for it.</s> <s>Measles needs roughly ninety-five percent vaccination coverage to stop spreading, because it's the most contagious common human pathogen we know, and a few percentage points is the whole difference between one contained case and an epidemic.</s> <s>Elimination is reversible... and the countries whose immunisation programmes are funded and normed by American agencies will feel the reversal too.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Hundreds of residents of Warraq Island in the Nile marched this week on a deadline they'd set themselves, after Egypt's development authority ignored demands they submitted a week earlier.</s> <s>In a country where street protest is effectively criminalised, that ultimatum is remarkable — and the removal itself is being done administratively, through a compensation schedule and a valuation the islanders never agreed to.</s> <s>They meet again on Friday to decide what comes next, and the authority's head still hasn't replied.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Ethiopia, the Amhara insurgency known as Fano has joined an eight-group alliance that includes Tigrayan forces — the same forces Amhara militias fought alongside the federal army only four years ago.</s> <s>That war killed hundreds of thousands over the contested lands of Welkait and Raya, and the two sides have now agreed to postpone the territorial question entirely in order to remove Abiy Ahmed first.</s> <s>What they haven't resolved is that border... and Ethiopia is the Horn's anchor, with Nile water and Red Sea access both riding on who governs Addis Ababa.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The flood toll at Rasuwagadhi, on the Nepal-China border, has jumped from nine dead to at least one hundred and sixty, with hundreds still missing.</s> <s>In a valley served by a single road, the confirmed-dead figure measures how far rescuers have walked rather than how many died, so a jump like that is the road reopening, not the water rising again.</s> <s>Experts say an avalanche of rock and ice, not rainfall, triggered the surge — which is why the gauges downstream fired far too late.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Colombia, drone attacks nearly quadrupled in a year, rising from thirty-eight to one hundred and forty-nine, according to <sub alias="the Armed Conflict Location and Event Data Project">ACLED</sub>.</s> <s>A six-hundred-dollar quadcopter carrying a bomb is now meeting a one-point-six-eight-billion-dollar national defence shield, and the National Liberation Army is arming faster than that shield adapts.</s> <s>Neighbourhoods once contested street by street are now controlled from the air.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Caracas, the parish of Twenty-third of January is bracing for a joint United States-Venezuelan operation — and residents believe the real target isn't the presidential palace but their own communal councils.</s> <s>Those councils run housing and food distribution, hold weapons, and answer to the barrio rather than to any ministry.</s> <s>Organiser Juan Contreras says the neighbourhood will defend itself, whatever the outcome in sha'Allah.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Kremlin sources have declared the peace talks with Kyiv dead, and signalled intensified ballistic missile strikes on the Ukrainian capital and its infrastructure.</s> <s>Moscow's framing Ukraine's recent refinery strikes as NATO-backed provocation, which is the language that historically precedes escalation rather than negotiation.</s> <s>Envoys Witkoff and Kushner have not said whether their channel survives.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Bank of Korea raised its policy rate to three percent at a second consecutive meeting — an unusual posture in Asia right now.</s> <s>What's driving it is a semiconductor boom, so this is a central bank tightening into a technology cycle rather than a commodity or wage cycle, which is what happens when one export sector effectively becomes the macroeconomy.</s> <s>Higher rates cool household credit and construction, but they can't cool chip demand set by foreign capital spending — so the burden of restraint lands entirely on Korean mortgage holders and small firms.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hayatabad Medical Complex in Peshawar has run out of medicine, after its finance director blocked payments to vendors.</s> <s>Pakistan's public hospitals run on supplier credit, so a payment freeze doesn't slow procurement — it stops it, and patients across the tribal districts must now buy drugs privately or go without.</s> <s>An anti-corruption inquiry is underway, though nobody's said when the shelves refill.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Africa's Treasury has counted eighty-eight-point-six billion rand sitting unclaimed in dormant bank accounts and pension funds.</s> <s>Whoever holds that money today earns its return while carrying no duty whatsoever to find the people it belongs to — which is the structural reason it stays unclaimed.</s> <s>Pretoria wants a single central administrator to trace beneficiaries instead of each institution tracing its own, and public comment's now open.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Meta drew up a plan this year to cut some teams by as much as sixty percent to become, in its own phrase, artificial-intelligence native — and then abandoned it.</s> <s>The abandonment is better evidence than any executive claim, because a company with the best models and unlimited compute worked out what its own tools could actually replace, and the answer wasn't sixty percent: coding assistants speed up narrow tasks, but headcount is mostly coordination, review and institutional memory.</s> <s>Executives elsewhere are still quoting those substitution ratios in budget season — in India, Egypt, Pakistan and the Philippines, where the jobs being modelled away are real.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nvidia reported ninety-six-point-two billion dollars of quarterly revenue, eighty-nine billion of it from data centres, and guided to one hundred and eight billion next quarter.</s> <s>That beat doesn't settle the question of who's funding the demand, because revenue is booked on shipment regardless of where the buyer's money came from — vendor financing shows up later, as an impairment, not in the quarter that records the sale.</s> <s>Two disclosures would tell us which it is... customer concentration, and the size of Nvidia's own stakes in its customers.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Five hundred and eighty million children — more than forty percent of the world's under-tens — now face at least twenty extra heat-stress days a year because of warming.</s> <s>A heat-stress day is defined against the body, not the thermometer: a wet-bulb temperature above twenty-eight degrees Celsius, the point where sweating stops working, and children reach it sooner because they sweat less and control less of their own exposure.</s> <s>The burden falls hardest across South Asia, the Sahel and West Africa, and it's education ministries — not emitters — now deciding whether the school day moves.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The <sub alias="the Food and Drug Administration">FDA</sub> has cleared a pill for pancreatic cancer that nearly doubled median survival, to thirteen-point-two months.</s> <s>RAS proteins drive most pancreatic tumours and were long considered undruggable because their surface offers no pocket for a small molecule to grip — daraxonrasib builds one, using a chaperone protein as scaffolding.</s> <s>Revolution Medicines hasn't disclosed what it'll charge.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Thousands of little penguins in Australia are to be vaccinated against bird flu, one wild animal at a time.</s> <s>You can't vaccinate a wild population, only a colony that's countable and catchable — and little penguins are flightless and return nightly to the same burrow, which makes them one of very few species where this is even attempted.</s> <s>Oceania is the last major region the virus hasn't reached, and it arrives with migrating birds, so this is a continent preparing for something it can't prevent.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in London traced a cattle virus across the Horn of Africa by trapping houseflies rather than sampling sick animals.</s> <s>Lumpy skin disease is normally confirmed by taking skin lesions, which means detection tracks veterinarian coverage rather than infection — so herders in places with no vets learn about an outbreak by losing the herd.</s> <s>Flies carry the viral traces days earlier, and they cost nothing to catch.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A judge in New York has thrown out Elon Musk's challenge to the state's Stop Hiding Hate law, which compels platforms to disclose how they handle hateful content, with fines of fifteen thousand dollars a day.</s> <s>Judge Cronan's ruling turns on a distinction most coverage will blur — the statute compels disclosure of a business practice, not removal of speech, and mandated transparency survives scrutiny that mandated suppression wouldn't.</s> <s>Every platform-regulation fight ahead, in the United States, the European Union and India, will be argued along that line.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Lebanese digital-rights group <sub alias="SMEX">SMEX</sub> asks what almost no spyware reporting does — what a journalist in Beirut or Cairo actually does the day after a forensic report confirms the infection.</s> <s>Notification without remedy transfers the entire burden to the target, and the forensic chain works against them: resetting or updating the phone destroys the very evidence needed to attribute the attack.</s> <s>Neither the vendors nor their government clients face any duty to notify anyone.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Japan, the constraint on Chinese-linked information operations was never intent — it was the language itself, fluent and register-correct Japanese at volume.</s> <s>Generative models remove precisely that barrier, and they also remove the tell investigators leaned on, because translation artefacts were how these campaigns were caught.</s> <s>That same asymmetry now applies wherever a language was its own defence... Urdu, Bahasa, Farsi, Arabic.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Navigation signals over Gdansk were jammed on sixty-three percent of days this month, and Poland hasn't publicly named who's doing it.</s> <s>A satellite positioning signal arrives at the ground weaker than background noise, which is why a modest transmitter can drown it out for miles — and the same signal times mobile networks, power grids, ship channels and aircraft approaches.</s> <s>It's the cheapest form of electronic warfare there is, and the hardest to attribute.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>